Diabetes Prediction with LLM Integration and Streamlit UI
This project aims to predict diabetes based on medical data using a machine learning model. It integrates Gemini LLM for natural language responses and explanations, and features a user-friendly interface built with Streamlit. The application is containerized using Docker to ensure seamless deployment across different environments.

